WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.001 line:92%
-Justin and I about to go

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:04.738
head-to-head or face-to-face
in a game of Facebreakers.

00:00:04.738 --> 00:00:07.640 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now, we're going to take turns
chipping golf balls

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:10.777 size:78% position:39%
at that wall of glass
with our faces on it.

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:14.014 align:start size:94% position:6%
That is my face.
That is Justin's face.

00:00:14.014 --> 00:00:15.782 line:92%
When we hear this sound...

00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:16.850 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Air horn blows ]
...that means it's

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:19.219
the speed round and we'll hit as
many balls as we possibly can.

00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:23.089
The first person to break all of
their opponent's faces wins.

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:25.458 align:start size:94% position:6%
And we're upping the stakes
a bit tonight.

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:28.795 align:start size:94% position:6%
FedEx will be donating
$1 million

00:00:28.795 --> 00:00:31.297 align:start size:94% position:6%
to St. Jude's
Children's Research Hospital

00:00:31.297 --> 00:00:33.633 size:84% position:42%
in the winner's name!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:33.633 --> 00:00:35.368 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:36.636 align:start size:94% position:6%
How cool is that?!
-Awesome.

00:00:36.636 --> 00:00:39.105 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's my first
high-stakes golf game.

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:39.939 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:43.877 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Justin, you're my guest.
You're up first.

00:00:43.877 --> 00:00:45.879 line:92%
Go on, try to break my face.

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:48.615 size:84% position:42%
-What club we got here?
We got a little 8-iron?

00:00:48.615 --> 00:00:49.349 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:49.349 --> 00:00:50.316 line:92%
Got some tunes. I like it.

00:00:50.316 --> 00:00:52.118 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is my kind of golfing
right here.

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:52.719 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I mean, come on.

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:56.122 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How hard do I need to
hit this thing?

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:59.059 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh! Oh! Fore!

00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:00.493 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:02.228 line:92%
-It's -- It's Facebreakers!

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:03.897
-I thought I was supposed to
actually try to break your face.

00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:07.100
-Good Lord. Oh, my gosh,
you literally almost broke

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:10.070 align:start size:94% position:6%
my actual something.
All right.

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:12.672 size:78% position:39%
-I feel like I should
cover up over here.

00:01:12.672 --> 00:01:17.110 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Here we go.

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:17.610 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:19.245 align:start size:94% position:6%
Ooh! From behind,
that would have been awesome.

00:01:19.245 --> 00:01:21.581 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, all right.
All right, you're up, buddy.

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:24.484 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, you got me all nervous
after that last one.

00:01:24.484 --> 00:01:26.486 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Got me nervous?
Please.

00:01:26.486 --> 00:01:28.988 line:92%
You're shaking right now, dude.

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:31.157 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh!
-What's your problem, dude?

00:01:31.157 --> 00:01:33.326 align:start size:94% position:6%
Watch.
Let me show you how it's done.

00:01:33.326 --> 00:01:36.396 size:78% position:39%
It's so easy, Justin.
Go like this. Watch.

00:01:36.396 --> 00:01:37.564 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Air horn blows ]

00:01:37.564 --> 00:01:39.165 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Rapid fire?
-Wait. All right, rapid fire.

00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:40.400 align:start size:94% position:6%
Here you go.
[ Air horn blows ]

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:42.135 line:92%
Here's the horn. Go for it!

00:01:42.135 --> 00:01:43.236 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Go, Jimmy!

00:01:43.236 --> 00:01:46.506 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:46.506 --> 00:01:49.509 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:01:51.244 --> 00:01:52.846 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:52.846 --> 00:01:55.048 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-Oh, look out! Fore!

00:01:55.048 --> 00:01:59.486 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Fore!

00:01:59.486 --> 00:02:02.288 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Oh, my God. [ Laughs ]

00:02:02.288 --> 00:02:03.590 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:05.391 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I win!

00:02:05.391 --> 00:02:06.826 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:11.397 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The champ!
The champion right there!

00:02:11.397 --> 00:02:12.665 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-I'm good at this game.

00:02:12.665 --> 00:02:16.169 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That means FedEx
will be donating $1 million

00:02:16.169 --> 00:02:19.672 align:start size:94% position:6%
to St. Jude's
Children's Research Hospital

00:02:19.672 --> 00:02:21.774 size:88% position:44% line:92%
in Justin Thomas's name.

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:24.944 line:92%
Justin Thomas, everybody!

00:02:24.944 --> 00:02:25.945 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Form was awful.

00:02:25.945 --> 00:02:30.049
Check him out in the FedEx cup
playoffs starting August 23rd.

00:02:30.049 --> 00:02:33.553
We'll be right back with
stand-up from Dusty Slay!

00:02:33.553 --> 00:02:35.155 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Stick around.

00:02:35.155 --> 00:02:37.557 size:84% position:42% line:92%
